QuestGuidance.Register("es",74,{
[2337]="70066614\n1\tCollect a deer carcass\tDeer can be found throughout the Blackroot Vale. Gúrion of Lancrath has posted a bounty seeking skilled hunters to defeat the wolf elders, Dokhvor and Húlthak, who now dwell in Eryn Asgath. You should collect a deer carcass to use as bait.\n2\tPlace the deer carcass in Eryn Asgath to draw out Dokhvor and Húlthak\tDokhvor and Húlthak can be found in Eryn Asgath in the Blackroot Vale. You have obtained a deer carcass from one of the many deer of the Blackroot Vale. You should use it as bait to draw out Dokhvor and Húlthak in Eryn Asgath.\n3\tDeliver Dokhvor and Húlthak's pelts to Gúrion in Lancrath\tGúrion can be found in Lancrath in the Blackroot Vale. You have defeated Dokhvor and Húlthak and taken their pelts. You should deliver the pelts to Gúrion in Lancrath.\n",
[2338]="7006AA45\n1\tDefeat the bog-lurker Drâghru\tDrâghru can be found in Ilmabiri; the Wells, west of the guard post Kruha-sûrja.\n2\tTalk to Nashôn\tYou have defeated Drâghru. You should return to Nashôn in Kruha-sûrja to report your success.\n",
[2339]="70053DC1\n1\tDefeat Easterling beast-masters in Parth Daenath (total: 4)\tEasterlings can be found in Parth Daenath. You should defeat Easterling beast-masters.\n2\tCompletado\tYou defeated a number of Easterlings and satisfied the bounty.\n",
[2340]="70071AD3\n1\tDerrota a Enudâri\tEnudâri is known to haunt the Mashâli Barrens north of the Crypts of Khâb Daku.\n2\tTalk to Halshûm in Khanâg Gur\tYou have defeated Enudâri. You should return to Khanâg Gur to collect your reward.\n",
[2341]="7007162F\n1\tCollect the head of Ershubât\030Defeat cobras in Nax Shalâl (total: 10)\tYou have accepted a bounty to collect the head of Ershubât the Cradle-thief and slay his spawn. You should travel to the hidden oasis, Nax Shalâl, and complete the bounty.\n2\tTalk to Ashâb\tYou have claimed the head of Ershubât the Cradle-thief. You should return to Ashâb at the Dawn-warden for your reward.\n",
[2342]="70071AD5\n1\tDerrota a Fer-nefâsi\tFer-nefâsi hunts her prey in the Hills of Haramûl, located in north central An Shêru.\n2\tTalk to Mísikir in Jiret-menêsh\tYou have defeated the roc Fer-nefâsi. You should return to Jiret-menêsh to collect your reward.\n",
[2343]="70059783\n1\tInvoca y enfréntate a Gethin Ojobuey\tGethin Ojobuey se encuentra en la Mina Este del Bosque Salvaje. Debes invocar a Gethin Ojobuey y enfrentarte a él.\n2\tCompletado\tGethin Ojobuey derrotado\n",
[2344]="700576BF\n1\tDefeat all goblins in Scraper's Clough.\t\n2\tReturn to Limlók and remove the completed bounty\tYou should return to Limlók and remove the completed bounty from the bounty board.\n",
[2345]="700576C1\n1\tDerrota a todos los trasgos en Tithroz.\t\n2\tReturn to Limlók and remove the completed bounty\tYou should return to Limlók and remove the completed bounty from the bounty board.\n",
[2346]="700576BC\n1\tDefeat all goblins at Veithhól.\t\n2\tReturn to Limlók and remove the completed bounty\tYou should return to Limlók and remove the completed bounty from the bounty board.\n",
[2347]="700576C0\n1\tDefeat all goblins at the forest's edge.\t\n2\tReturn to Limlók and remove the completed bounty\tYou should return to Limlók and remove the completed bounty from the bounty board.\n",
[2348]="700576B9\n1\tDerrota a todos los trasgos en Cabed Rhimdath.\t\n2\tReturn to Limlók and remove the completed bounty\tYou should return to Limlók and remove the completed bounty from the bounty board.\n",
[2349]="70000058\n1\tLleva las vainas de trasgo a Gadaric Mascador\030Reúne vainas de trasgo (total: 10)\tLos trasgos pueden encontrarse al noreste, bajo la sombra de la Cima de los Vientos, o en las ruinas de Minas Eriol, al sureste de la Posada Abandonada. Gadaric Mascador quiere reunir las vainas que llevan los trasgos en las Tierras Solitarias. NOTA: Las misiones de recompensa son repetibles, pero tienen un número limitado de completaciones. Esta misión puede completarse tres veces.\n",
[2350]="7000004C\n1\tLleva tabardos de trasgo a Lieva Lirioagrio\030Recoge tabardos de trasgo (total: 10)\tHay trasgos en las ruinas de Minas Eriol, al sureste de la Posada Abandonada, y en los campos de Annunlos. Para terminar su espantapájaros, Lieva Lirioagrio necesita algunos de los tabardos que usan los trasgos de Annunlos, pero nadie en la Posada Abandonada es lo suficientemente valiente para arriesgarse a recoger la tela para ella. Te ha pedido que recojas los tabardos en su lugar. NOTA: Las misiones de recompensa son repetibles, pero tienen un número limitado de completaciones. Esta misión puede completarse tres veces.\n",
[2351]="70053DC4\n1\tDefeat Urrog in Arandor\030Defeat Khahún in Arandor\030Defeat Shumauk in Arandor\tGertheryg can be found in Arandor. You should defeat the gorthorog triplets.\n2\tCompletado\tDefeated the gorthorog triplets.\n",
[2352]="7004E90C\n1\tDefeat Grazadhrú\030Defeat Ered Mithrin wood-trolls (total: 10)\tGrazadhrú and wood-trolls can be found in Ered Mithrin. You should defeat wood-trolls.\n2\tCompletado\tDefeated Grazadhrú.\n",
[2353]="7004E908\n1\tDefeat Gristlefell\030Defeat Mithrin láthbears (total: 10)\tGristlefell and Mithrin láthbears can be found in Ered Mithrin. You should defeat láthbears.\n2\tCompletado\tDefeated Gristlefell.\n",
[2354]="70071617\n1\tDerrota a Gírkhash\030Defeat bronze lizards in Idagâl (total: 10)\tYou have accepted a bounty to defeat Gírkhash and other bronze lizards in Idagâl. You should find and defeat these lizards.\n2\tTalk to Shâpar\tYou have defeated Gírkhash and many of his spawn. You should return to Shâpar in Ahâba for your reward.\n",
[2355]="7005A999\n1\tDefeat Gúrkug\030Defeat goblins in Máttugard (total: 10)\tGúrkug and goblins can be found in Máttugard. You should defeat goblins.\n2\tCompletado\tDefeated Gúrkug.\n",
[2356]="70041363\n1\tDefeat half-trolls in Dor-en-Ernil (total: 6)\tHalf-trolls can be found throughout Dor-en-Ernil. Defeat half-trolls in Dor-en-Ernil.\n2\tSpeak with Glírdor\tGlírdor is in Erchar's encampment in Dor-en-Ernil. You should speak with Glírdor.\n",
[2357]="7004135C\n1\tDefeat Haradrim in Dor-en-Ernil (total: 8)\tHaradrim can be found throughout Dor-en-Ernil. Defeat Haradrim in Dor-en-Ernil.\n2\tSpeak with Glanion\tGlanion is in the city of Linhir. You should speak with Glanion.\n",
[2358]="70009A14\n1\tHabla con Ballard Wilmer\tBallard Wilmer está en Ost Forod, el antiguo puesto de vigilancia en las colinas de Tyrn Fornech. Un cartel que ofrece una recompensa por la captura o derrota del saqueador de tumbas Enrico Riscarpado llamó tu atención. Si deseas solicitar esta recompensa, debes hablar con Ballard Wilmer.\n2\tDerrota a Harry Hinchcliffe\tEnrico Riscarpado se encuentra cerca de la puerta hacia Forochel, en Cirith Rhîw, al final del camino del norte a través de Tyrn Fornech. Has aceptado la comisión de reclamar la recompensa por Enrico Riscarpado, un tirador letal con el arco.\n3\tHabla con Ballard Wilmer\tBallard Wilmer está en Ost Forod, el antiguo puesto de vigilancia en las colinas de Tyrn Fornech. Has derrotado a Enrico Riscarpado y ahora debes informar a Ballard Wilmer.\n4\tHabla con Basil Gummidge\tBasilio Resinas está en Ost Forod, el antiguo puesto de vigilancia en las colinas de Tyrn Fornech. Has derrotado a Enrico Riscarpado y ahora debes informar a Basilio Resinas para recibir tu recompensa.\n",
[2359]="7004E90F\n1\tDefeat Holkorm\030Defeat Mithrin worms (total: 10)\tHolkorm and Mithrin worms can be found in Ered Mithrin. You should defeat worms.\n2\tCompletado\tDefeated Holkorm.\n",
[2360]="700358B3\n1\tDerrota a Iorwerth y recoge su blasón\tPuedes encontrar a Iorwerth en la Tumba de las Lomas Sinuosas, vigilando el túmulo desde afuera. Debes invocar y derrotar a Iorwerth, y recoger su blasón.\n2\tVuelve con Britric\tBritric está en Forlaw. Has derrotado a Iorwerth, y ahora debes regresar a Forlaw para cobrar tu recompensa.\n",
[2361]="700715AB\n1\tDefeat Jûkhtar and collect her venom\tThe malevolent spider Jûkhtar has been growing her brood and attacking Zajâni citizens near her burrow in Jâr Obadal. You are to defeat her and collect a sample of her venom. Bring it to Nazâkh in Zajâna, that she may give it to those who would prepare a salve to heal citizens poisoned by her children.\n2\tBring Jûkhtar's venom to Nazâkh in Zajâna\tBring Jûkhtar's venom to Nazâkh in Zajâna to collect your reward.\n",
[2362]="70071628\n1\tCollect the 'item of great value'\030Derrota a Kasâshu el Triturador\tYou have accepted a bounty to defeat Kasâshu the Grinder and reclaim something of great value from his belly. You should travel to Karmu Râx and complete the bounty.\n2\tTalk to Ashâb\tYou have reclaimed someone's severed hand from the dread-tortoise. You should return to Ashâb at the Dawn-warden for your reward.\n",
[2363]="7006BF7E\n1\tDefeat Kaursu and collect his vile armour\tMizâdi Shâra, Queen of Renewed Hamât, has posted a bounty seeking skilled soldiers to defeat the infamous Orc Kaursu, slayer of over fifty Hamâti warriors, and return to her Hand, Numûru, with his armour. He keeps his council with the Barkhûshim in Kûr Anzar.\n2\tBring Kaursu's vile armour to Numûru in Urmâkh\tBring Kaursu's vile armour to Numûru in Urmâkh to collect your reward.\n",
[2364]="700358FF\n1\tDerrota a Ojoagudo y recoge su pico\tPuedes encontrar a Ojoagudo en las Altas Lomas, sobre el túnel rocoso y la cascada congelada que cubren el camino del sur en las Altas Lomas. Debes invocar y derrotar a Ojoagudo, y recoger su pico.\n2\tLleva el pico a Britric\tBritric está en Forlaw. Has recogido el pico de Ojoagudo, y ahora debes regresar a Forlaw para cobrar tu recompensa.\n",
[2365]="7004E912\n1\tDefeat Keenclaw\030Defeat grey hawks (total: 10)\tKeenclaw and grey hawks can be found in Ered Mithrin. You should defeat hawks.\n2\tCompletado\tDefeated Keenclaw.\n",
[2366]="7006C6CE\n1\tDefeat Kigrush\tA bounty notice in Ub Nishir has asked for someone to defeat ruthless leader of a group of brigands in Zikrum-dûl to the east known as Kigrush.\n2\tReturn to Neshurga and inform him of Kigrush's defeat\tReturn to Neshurga in Ub Nishir north of Maurûsh and inform him that you have completed the bounty and defeated Kigrush.\n",
[2367]="700715AC\n1\tDefeat Korutásh and collect his jewelled dagger\tThe dread goblin Korutásh has slain many innocent people in Sen Chatâk with his raiding parties. You are to defeat him and return to Nazâkh with his bejewelled dagger. Korutásh can be found north-east of Sen Chatâk, in the hills of Glúkroz.\n2\tBring Korutásh's jewelled dagger to Nazâkh in Zajâna\tBring Korutásh's jewelled dagger to Nazâkh in Zajâna to collect your reward.\n",
[2368]="700358F0\n1\tDerrota a Krah y recoge su cuchillo\tSe puede invocar al Maestro de espías Krah justo al norte de Dunfast, en los Brezales Blancos. Debes invocar y derrotar a Krah, y recoger su cuchillo.\n2\tLleva el cuchillo a Britric\tBritric está en Forlaw. Has recogido el cuchillo del trasgo Maestro de espías Krah, y ahora debes regresar a Forlaw para cobrar tu recompensa.\n",
})
